rors.\",\"whyTestsDoNotAlreadyCoverThis\":\"attach_test.go has a v1 regression test for the missing-state duplicate-session case and a separate v2 attach smoke test, but no v2 review-attach duplicate test that combines the two behaviors.\",\"suggestedRegressionTest\":\"Add a checkpoints_version 2 test mirroring TestAttach_ReviewWithExistingCheckpointErrorsEvenWithoutSessionState: attach once, remove the session state file, run review attach for the same session, assert the existing-session error, and verify v2 metadata was not converted to review metadata.\",\"minimumFixScope\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go duplicate-session detection plus a v2 review-attach regression test.\"}],\"inspected\":{\"files\":[\"cmd/entire/cli/search_cmd.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/search_cmd_test.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/attach_test.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/api_client.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/auth.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_reader.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/activity_cmd.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/activity_render.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/activity_tui.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/agent_group.go\"],\"symbols\":[\"runSearch\",\"runAttach\",\"ensureCheckpointAvailable\",\"writeAttachCheckpointV2\",\"NewAuthenticatedAPIClient\",\"requireSecureBaseURL\",\"newCommittedCheckpointReader\"],\"notes\":[\"Read-only review; no tests were run.\",\"Focused on owned CLI package files and linked tests, with tests used as intended-behavior evidence.\"]}}","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
