serts it fails before issuing a request unless an explicit insecure opt-in is set.\",\"minimumFixScope\":\"cmd/entire/cli/search_cmd.go URL validation plus a focused command test.\"},{\"title\":\"Review attach duplicate-session guard misses v2-only checkpoints\",\"category\":\"data-loss\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go\",\"startLine\":236,\"endLine\":249,\"symbol\":null,\"quote\":null},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go\",\"startLine\":301,\"endLine\":313,\"symbol\":null,\"quote\":null},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go\",\"startLine\":340,\"endLine\":349,\"symbol\":null,\"quote\":null},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach_test.go\",\"startLine\":1373,\"endLine\":1418,\"symbol\":null,\"quote\":null},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach_test.go\",\"startLine\":355,\"endLine\":405,\"symbol\":null,\"quote\":null}],\"reasoning\":\"The review-mode defense-in-depth check only queries the v1 GitStore for an existing session in the HEAD checkpoint. In checkpoints_version == 2, v1 writes are skipped and the checkpoint is written through the v2 store, but the duplicate-session guard never checks the v2 store. The existing v1 regression test documents that a missing or stale session state file would otherwise allow an already-recorded session to be rewritten as a review; the same scenario remains uncovered and unguarded for v2-only storage.\",\"reproduction\":\"Enable checkpoint v2, attach a session normally to a commit, delete the session state file, then run review attach for the same session against the same HEAD checkpoint. The v1 guard will not find the v2 session, so the v2 write path can rewrite the existing session metadata as review data instead of returning the documented unsupported-rewrite error.\",\"recommendation\":\"Use the configured committed checkpoint reader/read mode for this duplicate-session check, or explicitly check the v2 store whenever v2 reads/writes are enabled. Treat only a genuine not-found result as safe to proceed; propagate other read errors.\",\"whyTestsDoNotAlreadyCoverThis\":\"attach_test.go has a v1 regression test for the missing-state duplicate-session case and a separate v2 attach smoke test, but no v2 review-attach duplicate test that combines the two behaviors.\",\"suggestedRegressionTest\":\"Add a checkpoints_version 2 test mirroring TestAttach_ReviewWithExistingCheckpointErrorsEvenWithoutSessionState: attach once, remove the session state file, run review attach for the same session, assert the existing-session error, and verify v2 metadata was not converted to review metadata.\",\"minimumFixScope\":\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go duplicate-session detection plus a v2 review-attach regression test.\"}],\"inspected\":{\"files\":[\"cmd/entire/cli/search_cmd.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/search_cmd_test.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/attach.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/attach_test.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/api_client.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/auth.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_reader.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/activity_cmd.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/activity_render.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/activity_tui.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/agent_group.go\"],\"symbols\":[\"runSearch\",\"runAttach\",\"ensureCheckpointAvailable\",\"writeAttachCheckpointV2\",\"NewAuthenticatedAPIClient\",\"requireSecureBaseURL\",\"newCommittedCheckpointReader\"],\"notes\":[\"Read-only review; no tests were run.\",\"Focused on owned CLI package files and linked tests, with tests used as intended-behavior evidence.\"]}}","completed_at":1779213584,"duration_ms":399644,"time_to_first_token_ms":42292}}
